	(text "The value for the DC-de-biasing capacitor (C23 and C24) \nshould be determined by experimentation but 68 pF is \nprobably a reasonable starting point. \n\nAs such, it is a good idea to use a hand-solderable package\nfor this component, and if possible, to place it somewhere\nwhere you can easily desolder it and solder a new cap."
